[{"id":164596796,"discussion_id":"ab36c4eb8423055407aec66ee00fa447210ccbe3","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| conversion/im2col | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-03-07T20:34:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T09:46:49+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164596802,"discussion_id":"c8d762a77301a49666241fcf9543447197d19aac","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-07T20:34:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-07T20:34:10+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164596817,"discussion_id":"385ff13804720953efaf8f10e595bd182fcbce24","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了Im2Col算子（NCHW格式）在判断是否采用“全载”策略时，因输入输出比例计算错误而可能导致性能下降的问题。原代码错误地使用了经过内存对齐后的字节大小来计算比例，导致在某些情况下错误地拒绝了更优的“全载”策略。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了 `NCHWTryFullLoad` 函数中的核心判断逻辑，将用于计算输入输出比例的 `ratio` 从基于对齐后内存大小的 `(inHWNeedSize) / outHWNeedSize`，更正为基于原始数据元素数量的 `(inputHW) / outputHW`。此修改确保了策略选择逻辑与设计意图一致，能够更准确地评估数据稀疏性，从而在合适的场景下启用更高效的“全载”策略以提升算子性能。","created_at":"2026-03-07T20:34:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-07T20:34:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164620443,"discussion_id":"687078b6f6967742b5e09ef7259651cf3efc6ce9","body":"操作数建议显示都cast到double","created_at":"2026-03-09T09:21:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T16:27:20+08:00","user":{"id":"68638987a39ca3530989c3b8","login":"LiuXinxin23","object_id":"68638987a39ca3530989c3b8","name":"LiuXinxin23","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/LiuXinxin23"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68638987a39ca3530989c3b8","login":"LiuXinxin23","object_id":"68638987a39ca3530989c3b8","name":"LiuXinxin23","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/LiuXinxin23"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":440,"end_new_line":440,"start_old_line":440,"end_old_line":440,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":164678007,"body":"changed this line on [2c9773fe](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/commits/detail/2c9773feb7a3c2342b4850613478f106c569ff00?ref=master&prId=1547) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/1547/diffs?diffId=5532924&start_sha=d730446508b769a6c19